# Server + online identity

## Server (`server/`)

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `docker-compose.yml` | Postgres + Nakama (`name: goofyballs`) |
| `.env` | Secrets (gitignored) |
| `nakama/local.yml` | Config + `runtime.env` (e.g. `YANDEX_AUTH_MODE`) |
| `nakama/modules/identity.lua` | RPCs + Yandex custom-auth hooks |
| `scripts/smoke.ps1` | Stack health |
| `scripts/smoke_identity.ps1` | Device auth + identity RPCs |

### Must

- Pin image tags; secrets in `.env`; mount `./nakama` → `/nakama/data`
- YAML under `server/` must use spaces only (tabs break Compose/Nakama parsers)
- Key all player data by Nakama `user_id` - never per-platform Storage collections
- Yandex uses **custom** auth (`yandex_<playerId>`); Google/Steam use native providers
- After changing modules: `docker compose restart nakama`

### Ports

`5432` Postgres · `7349` gRPC · `7350` HTTP/WS · `7351` Console (`HOST:CONTAINER`)

## Client (`src/features/online/`)

- `PlatformAuth` adapters: device, google (android/web), steam, yandex
- `OnlineService` optional — no auto-login unless `OnlineConfig.auto_authenticate_on_ready`
- Must not block offline AI / local 2P; `core/` must not import Nakama

### Provider ids

`device` · `google_android` · `google_web` · `steam` · `yandex`

